Stores concepts, mental models, insights and learnings. It is the "intellectual" part of the mind.

Save anything that generates emotional discomfort, similar to the [[Identity/_doc-identity]] section.
- Recommended: concepts, summaries of readings, experiments, processed ideas, and notes in Zettelkasten style.
- Should not contain: process documentation ([[Processes/_doc-processes]]), nor records of formal decisions ([[Decisions/_doc-decisions]]).
